\keywords{Cluster algebra, mixed Grassmannian, Demazure weave, signature.}

\begin{abstract}
	Generalizing the results by Fomin-Pylyavskyy and Carde, we construct a family of  natural cluster structures in the coordinate ring of a mixed Grassmannian, the configuration space of tuples of several vectors and covectors in a finite-dimensional complex vector space. We describe and explore these cluster structures using the machinery of weaves introduced by Casals and Zaslow. 
\end{abstract}


