Notice that the intersection pairing is skew-symmetric by construction. Quiver interpretation of intersection pairing of cycles is shown in Figure~\ref{fig: local intersection pair graph}, where an arrow from $\gamma$ to $\gamma'$ contributes $+1$ to $\langle \gamma, \gamma'\rangle$ and $-1$ to $\langle \gamma', \gamma \rangle$. 

