	Notice that in general, $\lrpush{\mcg}{i}{\mch}{j}$ is NOT equal to $\lpush{\mcg}{i}{\big(\rpush{\mch}{\mcg}{j}\big)}$, nor to $\rpush{\big(\lpush{\mcg}{i}{\mch}\big)}{\mcg}{j}$.
