		With notation as in Case 1(a) of Proposition \ref{prop: decoration flags of the initial weave}, we have
		\[
		\Delta_{\gamma(r, 1)} = \mcf_p^r \wedge \mcf_t^{d-r}, \quad \text{with } \, t = p+r+1.
