   \end{cases}
\end{align}
These inequalities condense into
$- \min \{k, k' \} \leq \nu_{\alpha' \alpha} \leq \min \{k, k' \}$.
Now, we perform the sum over $\nu_{\alpha' \alpha} \, .$ This variable becomes $\Delta s$, due to the $\delta_{s_{\alpha'} \, (s_\alpha + \Delta s)}$ in Eq.~\eqref{eq_S_w_app_help3}. 

