 \max_{1 \le j \le p} \| \hat{\Theta}_{PCR,j}' - \Theta_{j}' \|_2 &=& O_p \left(K \sqrt{logp} \max (  \frac{\sqrt{log n + K}}{\sqrt{n \delta_n}}, \frac{\sqrt{K}}{\sqrt{\bar{\xi} \delta_n}})\right)\nonumber \\
