	\[ a_{2n}^{1/2} K (\sqrt{log p}) r_{RRE-l}=  a_{2n}^{1/2} K \sqrt{log p} \max( \sqrt{\frac{log n + p}{n}}, \sqrt{\frac{K}{\bar{\xi}}}),\]
