\item  As described in Remark 5-item 2 of Corollary 3 and item 1 above, double descent is possible in RRE in precision matrix estimation. This extends the concept of double descent from linear regression to precision matrix estimation. This may have important consequences in empirics. We show one of these findings in Sharpe Ratio in US Stock market.


\end{itemize}
\end{remark}


