Relying on  (\ref{58a})(\ref{60})(\ref{62})(\ref{63}), and keeping in mind that  (\ref{62}) has the largest rate  by Assumptions 3 and \ref{as5}(i), and  we have the following for  the second right side term in (\ref{49})
