\end{align}

Note that $dW_t=\rho dB_t+\sqrt{1-\rho^2}d\bar{B}_t$ where $\{B_t,t\ge 0\}$ and $\{\bar{B}_t,t\ge 0\}$ are two independent standard Brownian motion. After the successive transformations, we obtain the SDE system of $\boldsymbol{X}_t=(\widetilde{P}_t^\pm, \widetilde{Q}_t^\pm, \widetilde{V}_t)^\top$ from the SDE \eqref{eq:sticky-process-SDE}:
\begin{align}\label{eq:final-sticky-process-SDE}
