    \caption{Feature data model in Deriva-ML. Each Feature is defined by four key connections: (1) a unique feature name, (2) a reference to the source record in a domain-specific table, (3) the Execution that generated it, and (4) the feature value, which may be a scalar, a controlled vocabulary term, or a file-based object represented by an Asset entity.}
    \label{fig-featureERD}
