Delithiation was performed using the same apparatus using a 0.5M solution of nitrosonium tetrafluoroborate (98$\%$, Thermo Fisher) dissolved in acetonitrile (DrySolv, $\geq$95$\%$, Sigma, Aldrich). The single post Cu grids with lamellae attached were immersed again in 10 mL for 10 s to deinsert Li-ions as per: 
